---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import bookCoverImage from "../assets/memoir-book.png";
import "../styles/book-page.css";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="The Book | Dare to Break Free"
  description="An unflinching memoir of addiction, reinvention, resilience and reckoning."
>
  <section class="book-page" aria-labelledby="book-title">
    <div class="book-page__inner">
      <figure class="book-page__cover">
        <Image
          src={bookCoverImage}
          alt="Cover of Dare to Break Free by Kali Harmen"
          widths={[320, 480, 640, 800]}
          sizes="(max-width: 760px) 70vw, 32vw"
          format="webp"
          quality={84}
          loading="eager"
        />
      </figure>

      <div class="book-page__copy">
        <p class="book-page__eyebrow">The memoir</p>
        <h1 id="book-title">Dare to Break Free</h1>

        <div class="book-page__bio">
          <p>This memoir is an unflinching account of a young girl who spirals from carefree days into the chaos of heroin and crack addiction. It follows her fight to break free and rebuild her life. After finding an unconventional way to get clean, Kali remains trapped in financial struggle.</p>

          <p>Determined to escape poverty, she takes on a role that shifts her world entirely—moving from sleeping on a friend’s mattress to living in one of the wealthiest parts of town.</p>

          <p>But this isn’t a simple rags-to-riches story. That leap comes at a great personal cost, forcing Kali to confront the sacrifices she’s made and grapple with the woman she wants to become.</p>

          <p>Raw and honest, <em>Dare to Break Free</em> is a story of resilience and reckoning that refuses to wrap life neatly in a bow. It speaks to anyone who has ever felt stuck or overwhelmed, reminding us that even the darkest paths can hold the promise of light.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
